You can disable the claude.ai cloud connectors (Gmail, Google Calendar, etc.) by setting the `ENABLE_CLAUDEAI_MCP_SERVERS` environment variable to `false`.

Add this to your `~/.claude/settings.json`:

```json
{
  "env": {
    "ENABLE_CLAUDEAI_MCP_SERVERS": "false"
  }
}
```

Reference: https://code.claude.com/docs/en/mcp#use-mcp-servers-from-claude-ai
